{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img alt=\"「GTA6」約10萬日圓的高級收藏家盒將於10月30日開始接受預約！內含帽子與一口杯等能品味世界觀的11件物品\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"504\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/132940e71b1cc723514230257615d3e03ccd4c396ab682505985dc2e7f07831d/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F5bd947b7a330797611a97d4d3f258d34.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>「GTA6」約10萬日圓的高級收藏家盒將於10月30日開始接受預約！內含帽子與一口杯等能品味世界觀的11件物品</figcaption></figure><p>株式會社卡普空宣布，將於與遊戲發售日同一天的2026年11月19日(四)發售「<strong>俠盜獵車手VI</strong>(以下稱GTA6)」的高級<strong>收藏家盒</strong>。<br/>日本國內將限定於卡普空官方通販網站「e-Capcom」，自2026年10月30日(五)12:00(UTC+9)起開始接受預約。</p><h2>「GTA6」的高級收藏家盒確定於日本國內發售！陣容包含11件時尚物品</h2><figure><img alt=\"「GTA6」收藏家盒\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"960\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/27f0dadcc095d1649bb89276d979d6e4620891d552dd926a2362c534ec69af73/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F32a72794597cf44b0565b945db020238.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>「GTA6」收藏家盒</figcaption></figure><p>「GTA6」的高級收藏家盒 確定由卡普空於日本國內發售！<br/>內含帽子、一口杯、鑰匙圈等能享受遊戲世界觀的時尚周邊<strong>11件</strong>。<br/>建議售價為<strong>99,980日圓</strong>(含稅)。</p><h3>內含11件酷炫物品！「GTA6」收藏家盒的內容物</h3><h4>Macca the Gator 公仔</h4><figure><p><img alt=\"Macca the Gator 公仔\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"960\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/0c7d37631253a2394e3f01af8d2d3eae4a19c1e7a0dc864d12ef89a3a72c0084/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F8d5def7d16f4ed5db2c86e249b0d1359.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></p></figure><p></p><p>享受香菸與紅鶴・血腥・馬天尼的Macca公仔。<br/>底座採扭轉即可開啟的設計，也能偷偷藏放貴重物品。</p><p><p></p><p><p></p><p></p><p></p></p></p><h4>Oakley Frogskins 太陽眼鏡</h4><figure><p><img alt=\"Oakley Frogskins 太陽眼鏡\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"960\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/020e23d874ea44621c30a3890ec2987bdf8f591dba7c9f11e98e24539f5ee9b7/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F0da2a5ef2942cf1120ceed0dcd34b74c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></p></figure><p>遮擋雷歐尼達陽光的霧黑色Oakley Frogskins 太陽眼鏡。<br/>Prizm Sapphire鏡片與罪惡城市粉的「GTAVI」標誌為其亮點。</p><h4>New Era 9FORTY 棒球帽</h4><figure><p><img alt=\"New Era 9FORTY 棒球帽\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"960\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/3a5af669ca154ca81cf565a01236d0ee3e08db7345bdf3f78729660afeef0163/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F62b2c1e5765110be7c27fff7ec0f43c0.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></p></figure><p>施有「Vice City Leonida」裝飾、刺繡、貼布繡的New Era 9FORTY A-Frame棒球帽。<br/>戴上它，彷彿就能感受當地居民的心情！</p><h4>雷歐尼達鑰匙 斜背包</h4><figure><p><img alt=\"雷歐尼達鑰匙 斜背包\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"960\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/14c133e12f82dd7f17f8e96a65dfbe50cff747de8ade5b3efe9467baee534c4f/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fe76ebb49755a139447d79f735ff9a17a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></p></figure><p>防撕裂布料的斜背包。<br/>黑與粉圖案的內裡施有織章。</p><h4>Manatee的Chunky 一口杯</h4><figure><p><img alt=\"Manatee的Chunky 一口杯\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"960\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/14a295f76b145f7b48234dbddb0d0b85768b44ffbc475c6aacd17e308a86b2b1/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Faa8dd4dfe2f34324426e27ae97ac28bc.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></p></figure><p>正面雷射加工Manatee的Chunky、底面雷射加工Rockstar Games標誌的一口杯。<br/>一邊玩遊戲，一邊用這個杯子小酌也是種樂趣。</p><h4>罪惡城市 剃刀鑰匙圈</h4><figure><p><img alt=\"罪惡城市 剃刀鑰匙圈\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"960\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/eee1497e8d597bd61a25ddb72be30953814d9a0bde08c2b1018d9d56074565ef/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F10b325a3ab2414c351aeaedf1b9c7a8e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></p></figure><p>壓印「GTAVI」與罪惡城市標誌的金屬質感剃刀造型鑰匙圈。</p><h4>罪惡城市 收藏 吧台匙</h4><figure><p><img alt=\"罪惡城市 收藏 吧台匙\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"960\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/64bcc040d9e9dc068eabf17b36af9553d59054b6f8c5b499d79f5cbf0e402026/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F5ab17243d7e9836bfa9c1bbcb4f129c8.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></p></figure><p>施有壓紋琺瑯的罪惡城市標誌，前端帶有Rockstar Games標誌的裝飾用湯匙。</p><h4>雷歐尼達鑰匙 琺瑯徽章組(附金屬罐)</h4><figure><p><img alt=\"雷歐尼達鑰匙 琺瑯徽章組(附金屬罐)\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"960\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/8df90f833c6c6c93a11b6cb36674c9f5cbacda162f86430744d3a19b9a34636a/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fd708ee102fa80c12f4208df20d42d698.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></p></figure><p>附客製化罐的9個琺瑯徽章，讓任何東西都能呈現罪惡城市洗鍊的風格！</p><h4>Macca the Gator 磁鐵鏡</h4><figure><p><img alt=\"Macca the Gator 磁鐵鏡\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"960\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/f09d0d067eb5cdbb118c9f3ba4c195fd52fb6c6ccff449daf5cec6f5ee8828fb/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fe5e8dd2de91af2b0921a937aa40b9e9f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></p></figure><p>彷彿映照出自身人生選擇的電鍍粉色玻璃鏡。<br/>可作為托盤使用，或利用背面2個大磁鐵作為藝術品裝飾。</p><h4>雷歐尼達鑰匙 貼紙包(附袋)</h4><figure><p><img alt=\"雷歐尼達鑰匙 貼紙包(附袋)\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"960\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/b754a2d4342074fa5991b501eaa99f5dde06cb1458757f28698f801e850ef8ab/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F9e69869992bbc98b6d9d994a368d1abe.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></p></figure><p>裝在袋中的9張乙烯基貼紙(背面附切線)。<br/>貼在筆記型電腦或水壺等喜歡的地方，增添雷歐尼達的風味吧。</p><h4>附雷歐尼達地圖的伴手禮海報(雙面)</h4><figure><p><img alt=\"附雷歐尼達地圖的伴手禮海報(雙面)\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"960\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/5d659177ed770e74953622a39d9509e28ab71d8f6a4fd576dd4712b4b3b6f81c/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F37a7d03132768b1101a7cd6addb6bd8a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></p></figure><p>正面為雷歐尼達地形地圖，背面為插圖的海報。<br/>不妨試著規劃一場遍遊美好時光州的旅程吧。</p><h3>「GTA6」收藏家盒將於10月30日開始接受預約！</h3><p>本收藏家盒預定於與遊戲發售同一天的2026年11月19日(四)發售。<br/>日本國內將限定於<a href=\"https://www.e-capcom.com/shop/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">卡普空官方通販網站「e-Capcom」</a>開始接受預約。</p><ul><li><p>預約受理開始日期時間：2026年10月30日(五)12:00～(UTC+9)</p></li></ul><p>由於<strong>數量限定</strong>，想購買的人請別錯過這個機會！<br/>另外，請注意本收藏家盒並未包含「GTA6」遊戲本體。<br/>「GTA6」的最新資訊請鎖定Rockstar Games官方X(<a href=\"https://twitter.com/RockstarGames\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">@RockstarGames</a>)。</p><blockquote><p></p><p>Introducing Grand Theft Auto VI: The Goodtime State – Vice City Collection</p><p>Pre-order this premium Grand Theft Auto VI collectible set featuring all the essentials for a good time, inspired by Leonida's hit TV show, Macca the Gator, while supplies last: <a href=\"https://t.co/2BLRBvugpU\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://t.co/2BLRBvugpU</a><a href=\"https://t.co/dtiBXQr2Lv\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">pic.twitter.com/dtiBXQr2Lv</a></p><p>— Rockstar Games (@RockstarGames) <a href=\"https://x.com/RockstarGames/status/2103138661667627456?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">September 24, 2026</a></p></blockquote><table><tbody><tr><td><p>商品概要</p></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><p>商品名</p></td><td><p>Grand Theft Auto VI:The Goodtime State - Vice City Collection</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>發售日</p></td><td><p>2026年11月19日(四)</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>建議售價</p></td><td><p>99,980日圓(含稅)</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p>The post <a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/product/gta-vi-goodtime-state-vice-city-collection-announcement/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">「GTA6」約10萬日圓的高級收藏家盒將於10月30日開始接受預約！內含帽子與一口杯等能品味世界觀的11件物品</a> first appeared on <a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Saiga NAK</a>. </p><hr/><h4>延伸閱讀</h4><p><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/product/ps5-resident-evil-village-zone-collaboration/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">✅PS5 × 惡靈古堡 村莊 × ZONe聯名組合包發售決定！預約開始！</a><br/><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/product/monsterhunter-rise-sunbreak-capcom-store-jun2022/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">✅財運要提升了！「MONSTER HUNTER RISE」中熟悉的「艾露猫不倒翁金」和「兔團子吉祥物」在CAPCOM STORE登場！</a><br/><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/product/nintendo-my-mario-release-date/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">✅兒童產品系列「MY MARIO」將於8月26日起上市！親子一起同樂吧！</a><br/><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/product/razer-barracuda-x/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">✅USB Type-C無線接收器實現全平台通用！Razer發表「Barracuda X」無線耳機麥克風</a><br/><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/product/impress-web3-teaching-book-discontinued/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">✅由 Impress 發行的《最簡單易懂的 Web3 教科書》停售並回收，作者是內閣官房的專家</a><br/><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/translator/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">✅日語到繁體中文的翻譯者招聘</a></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T00:21:16.008166+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":2129,"images":13,"source":"Yahoo 科技","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T07:04:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T02:38:46.704873+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T00:18:47.235370+00:00","content_hash":"d98b6204aa06e8bdac634c3a09a9918dae1353b5b41777e5d786669dc5d36776","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}